{"server":"en","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-03_end","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-03","title":"Lost at Once","storyCode":"6-3","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-03_end.txt","sourceHash":"dfff14dd8088ce01b9fcb53655c16e8ec72846e5db716f456b68e21b8886918b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（后）\nHow many men have fallen before you?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"(Speaking Ursine)."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course. I will bring it back for you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...... (Speaking Ursine)......?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"No. I'm not going to Chernobog."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"Rest."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"You'll be safe here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"Get some rest."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"How many men have fallen before me?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"Drop your weapon!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Just you...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"Move and I shoot!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"Shoot first. Then ask questions."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"What? He... disappeared?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"No... I saw your file. You're Faust, one of their leaders. Your Arts won't fool me!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"I know this is just an optical trick. If I shoot, you'll still have a bolt in your head."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"Wrong."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"——!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"Can you predict my movements?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"The two of us, lone crossbowmen. If we both pull the trigger at the same time, we both die."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"What's your name?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"Codename GreyThroat. When did you get behind me?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"The third time you blinked."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"You're pretty direct..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"You've been separated from your squad. I'm not here to kill people who don't want a fight."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"We're enemies."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island is here to save the Infected. I saw you helping them."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"Those were my comrades. You're my enemy."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"When did Rhodes Island hire someone so naive?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, I'm naive. All I can do is follow orders. I freeze up whenever I have to make a decision for myself."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"You need to be careful."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"Watch your finger!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"That's a single shot crossbow. If I dodge your bolt, you're dead. Don't pull that trigger."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"If you only follow orders, if you rely on everyone else to tell you what to do, that can only end poorly."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"Why?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"Most of the sheep who blindly take orders aren't actually dependent on anyone. They just haven't started thinking for themselves..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"And those who have no direction in life, they're just empty machines looking for a sense of accomplishment, and meaning."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"You activate, and perform your function, you input a goal, you achieve your goal, until you consume everything around you, and you consume those you serve."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"I won't."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"You're inexperienced."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"I saw your interaction with the Infected back there. You're doing the right thing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"Your opinion means nothing to me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"Faust, you've been avoiding the L. G. D. Even the ones who are out here on their own, you haven't shot at them. I've been watching you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't take my patience for weakness. If I ambushed you, you'd be dead."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"But you didn't."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"You're exhausted. Take it from a crossbowman, your string is drawn too tight. It's definitely going to snap."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"Take it from a crossbowman, you're too much."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"You've also seen those... special Infected. We can figure this one out together."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"Maybe you're right."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"Wait!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"But there's nothing I can do."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"(He disappeared the instant he moved...? I can't figure his position!)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......hm?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"Why haven't you killed me?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"You didn't shoot. Neither will I."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"But next time? If you don't kill me, I will kill you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't want to hurt you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"That's too bad."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"I guess you need someone to answer you. Without an answer, you can't understand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't worry about it. Killing, dying, these are everyday facts of life. Even for Rhodes Island."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"Why can't we work together to save them?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"I really wish I could. But I know I can't."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't follow me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"You still don't know them. You don't yet have the whole picture."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"...and me? There's nothing I can do anymore."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"How many men have fallen because of things I did? How many men have fallen because of things I didn't do?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","aliases":["Faust"]},{"speakerId":"char_367_swllow","aliases":["???","GreyThroat"]}]}
